flowchart TB
  accTitle: Ahrara delivery architecture
  accDescr: SMTP delivers email to the Ahrara Relay. WSS connects the relay through Cloudflare Tunnel to Ahrara or an application using an SDK. Accepted messages are saved in an encrypted inbox on the user’s device.
  Provider(["`📨 **Email provider**`"])
  subgraph Remote["🌐 Remote infrastructure"]
    Routing["`☁️ **Cloudflare Email Routing**`"]
    Server["`🛰️ **Ahrara Relay**`"]
    Tunnel["`☁️ **Cloudflare Tunnel**`"]
    Routing -->|SMTP + STARTTLS| Server
    Server <--> Tunnel
  end
  subgraph Local["💻 Your computer"]
    Client["`🦜 **Ahrara**
    Terminal · Web · API · MCP`"]
    SDK["`🧩 **Application with SDK**
    Email automation`"]
    Inbox[("`🗄️ **Encrypted local inbox**`")]
    SDKInbox[("`🗄️ **SDK profile**
    SQLCipher`")]
    Client <-->|save / read| Inbox
    SDK <-->|save / read| SDKInbox
  end
  Provider --> Routing
  Tunnel <-->|WSS| Client
  Tunnel <-->|WSS| SDK

  classDef sender fill:#fff4e5,stroke:#f59e0b,stroke-width:2px,color:#7c2d12
  classDef cloud fill:#f1f5f9,stroke:#94a3b8,stroke-width:2px,color:#0f172a
